\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. O come little children, 
\par I pray ye come all,
\par And join with the shepherds 
\par at Bethlehem's stall;
\par There see what the Father, 
\par to do us delight,
\par Hath sent to the earth on 
\par this glorious night.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. O bow, little children, 
\par O bend low and pray,
\par With little hands folded 
\par thank God, as did they;
\par Sing lustily, children, 
\par with glad tuneful voice,
\par O sing with the angels, 
\par and like them rejoice!\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

